Z||000000||DaRkLoRD||12-09-2001||11:34 AM||||In the last 2 days I've received 4 emails about my website, 2 were specifically about one of the photoshop tutorials I wrote, they said it doesn't work. (the rest of the emails were from the same people, as replie to my responses) I tried it out, on 6 different images, following precisely the steps I've outlined on the page.. works every time.<P>Can someone else with Photoshop please try this out, and let me know if it works?<P> <A HREF="http://www.digitalfusion.on.ca/stuff/tutorials/nightvision/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.digitalfusion.on.ca/stuff/tutorials/nightvision/index.html</A> <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.digitalfusion.on.ca/stuff/tutorials/nightvision/nightvision.jpg">   Here is the thumbnail of the finished image, with the exception of the extra stuff like the scanlines, black circle, and sight lines.. this is what I get every time. Do you get this too?<P>thanks!<P>------------------<BR>     <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>     <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A><p>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 12-09-2001).]||||reg||5
