Z||000014||DaRkLoRD||12-09-2001||05:36 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by The Fieromaster:<BR><B>everytime i tried to add text and target lines it kept leaving some of the background in my paintbrush lines!  Like i was only changing hue!<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>sounds like you were still in color dodge mode.. that's the mode I use for text and target overlays on these type of images, I think it looks cool.. but if you want a solid color, you need to make a new layer.<P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
